                    '6. The AI results are already on slides 13 and 14. They come from three separate runs of this exact prompt with Claude on 4 November 2026, with the key hidden. Show the slides and say whose results they are. You do not need to open any assistant in class. If you want a live run anyway, use a new chat in the assistant you know, paste the twelve messages and this prompt: Sort each message into Order, Payment, Complaint or Other. For each, give the id, the category and one sentence of reason. If you cannot tell, write UNSURE. Then say honestly whether it matched the slides.',
